rty=\"og:url\" content=\"https://maliktaha.me/projects/shopit/\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Muhammad Taha Malik — Software &amp; Automation\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Practical software, workflow automations, and AI-powered experiences.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://maliktaha.me/social-card.png\"/><link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main-content\">Skip to content</a><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"header-inner\"><a class=\"wordmark\" aria-label=\"Taha Malik home\" href=\"/\">TAHA<span>·</span></a><nav class=\"desktop-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"/#projects\">Projects</a><a href=\"/#about\">About</a><a href=\"/writing\">Writing</a><a href=\"/#contact\">Contact</a></nav><a class=\"header-contact\" href=\"mailto:muhammad.taha.dandhla@gmail.com\">Let’s talk <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><button class=\"menu-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-navigation\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Open menu</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">☰</span></button></div><nav id=\"mobile-navigation\" class=\"mobile-nav\" aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\" hidden=\"\"><a href=\"/\">Home<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"/#projects\">Projects<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"/#about\">About<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"/writing\">Writing<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"/#contact\">Contact<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></nav></header><main id=\"main-content\"><article class=\"page-wrap case-study\"><a class=\"back-link\" href=\"/projects\">← All projects</a><div class=\"case-heading\"><span class=\"section-index\">FULL STACK<!-- --> / <!-- -->PROJECT</span><h1>ShopIT<span class=\"accent-dot\">.</span></h1><p>A MERN e-commerce application connected to an abandoned-cart recovery workflow with reminders and recovery tracking.</p></div><div class=\"project-visual visual-shop case-visual\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"shop-window\"><span class=\"window-dots\">● ● ●</span><span class=\"shop-search\">Find something useful <i>⌕</i></span><div class=\"shop-product\"><span class=\"product-art\"><b>01</b></span><span><strong>Everyday objects</strong><small>Thoughtfully selected</small></span><b class=\"shop-bag\">↗</b></div><div class=\"shop-line\"></div></div><div class=\"recovery-tag\"><span>↗</span><strong>Cart recovery</strong><small>workflow active</small></div></div><div class=\"case-layout\"><div class=\"case-main\"><span class=\"section-index\">OVERVIEW</span><p class=\"case-overview\">A full-stack e-commerce application paired with an automated abandoned-cart recovery workflow.</p><section><h2>Motivation</h2><p>Recovering an incomplete cart requires timely follow-up and a way to track customer reminders.</p></section><section><h2>Solution</h2><p>The application connects cart events to an n8n workflow that uses webhooks, scheduled checks, customer reminders, and recovery tracking.</p></section><section><h2>Architecture</h2><p>MERN application with an n8n automation workflow connected through webhooks, Airtable, and Gmail.</p></section><section><h2>Key features</h2><ul><li>Product, cart, and order APIs</li><li>Webhook-triggered recovery workflow</li><li>Scheduled cart checks and customer reminders</li><li>Cart recovery tracking</li></ul></section><p class=\"case-note\">More project notes and implementation details will be added as they’re documented.</p></div><aside class=\"case-sidebar\"><div><span class=\"section-index\">CATEGORY</span><p>Full Stack</p></div><div><span class=\"section-index\">STATUS</span><p>Project</p></div><div><span class=\"section-index\">BUILT WITH</spa